{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1478,
  "batch_count": 1701,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "624b11ee6bac4894f9e1bac15c5037fc7d787286",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9171c1abdea714202f9feaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "凉感商品……没有卖完。\r\n不……我并不是买太多──\r\n……是明年夏天要用的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8cc196ff3cb68e19d2636a0f74bb17b1768fb09dcfab7aa39cb0e52a8fb2fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69c40542a3741288553eaff8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "美妙让我体验过的──「暖炉桌」。\r\n那真是──不错。\r\n是个非常棒的──东西……",
      "source_fingerprint": "faa72719b3350907d52edf780b07da69010ac0659f39ab163ad1f5f1fc114d4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2434450737638f5f3f4a0bfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『機械人形とは、また奇怪な』\r\n…ルドルフに言われたが――\r\nそんなに――おかしい役だろうか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "adf6987c1dfb3651102924f40ab42a166d087312bf42443aebb9505bad352ab0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:227ebc110612b338de34c2d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ファインが――SP隊の制服も――\r\n機械人形風に――してみたい、と。\r\n――目立ちすぎる――と思うが。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5966a1b43709153f40f977a945267fe32e95d4d5f87a13a303a947510a568c1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0973d55e94940c21268d114b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私は――目の前の任務。タップは\r\n――大きな夢。視点は――違えど\r\n――想いは――理解できる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10447e03b00b49d03c137826f5246fa388724c54c26dc75cc0a0115d2612efad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7099880c038a4a968379d4f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ギムレットは――感情豊かな演技が\r\n得意だが――反面何を演じても――\r\nギムレットのまま――私も同じだが",
      "source_fingerprint": "01f6360fe301a691ea2c650e07c13ef79c339ec8be7db8ead33933b793d994cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66878fc09c8793393db0db0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "シャカール曰く――機械の形態は\r\n――simpleで――あるべきと。\r\nなら――段ボールでも、かぶるか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f14565adae8ae0eb3bfc22c3b1ee6760cd110329a9f81661b3feb32bc0b37a35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b03faa1f44b9fa1d08538b27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "起動。本日の業務を開始――\r\n――この言い回しでは――むしろ\r\nscience fiction――寄りか",
      "source_fingerprint": "db9d505f35099a3a2ec85ed0e67de88e16bf05cb5f83ec4816731825788e7714",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1183f7462971d667658e2177",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "食後のteaはいかがですか？\r\n――本当の機械なら――実に正確な\r\n淹れ方を――するのだろうな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86ab6bdb2e30c5291cc8942e310e2c8dda3d00e0cde8559800dddb7d9501cb6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da02341b90b9480159d72aa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "そろそろ――就寝か？必要なら――\r\n朝――目覚まし機能を――\r\n実行――するが。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53a14f0c338c975d420e656389bbb210aceb5777d26707fab2deecaf45df2491",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02d1956a1f965151633faeae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どうも――新入生の何人かが――\r\n私を――本物の機械人形と――\r\n思っている節が――ある。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17f649fa7a0df77a9368e6240f0a0ed1fda6dbce7901817ccc3ea7b595d16946",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7300220017b0a383c5c12ab1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Shaved ice――\r\n機械人形の――つもりで、食しても\r\n――頭痛は――避けられないか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d13c157039629b1a7ce59989e1e162ba59169f8e830254bb4b85c93cb9084cdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:209306893528cb620b3fd04f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Halloween――あまり――\r\n参加したことは――ないが――\r\nこの衣装がある――今なら――",
      "source_fingerprint": "157dba3cebfb0213b3bd2e12e59e9b7aa7d27815d24245cd7cb17ffc6f2ed511",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eec1d475fc118e80d5ae4eb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私は機械人形。寒さなど感じない。\r\n――思い込もうと――してみたが。\r\nどうやら――不可能だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08940f9954ce16df291e2731ef90db710c76d4da9d7900ff5e52f23da12fd610",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a6b9e5393b393c0f2befa52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衣装にある――修繕の形跡。\r\n服としての使命を――懸命に、\r\n果たし続けている――respect.",
      "source_fingerprint": "a53e671e4065a9c8b5d69a26190956addb515d45568ba90412964ef6a576a1a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9ce102e5419eded6ea08405",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外で――子どもたちに――強そうな\r\nロボがいる、と――言われた。\r\nそういう設定では――ないのだが。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c6fece4b6686bf22e43b0b8bff9eafd97a705b3ae033bbf8485fb03f29b770a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01373f00c24b5b88f02d120e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Let's get started.\r\n训练员──请下指令。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86150db31e87834dc648b4c2c7a8cf01ffe5629bf1acb3e6b89fdd30f16d1cf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:845fe29d34c437e6601c940e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "遂行する",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ce38b5ebbca8b8bf5b5b4917a142eed5cfaacf416234b26fd17a26c783c2b66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9265268417ffb11bfc605c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要报恩──\r\n没别的方法──就是训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "774f8dbde92278f5b94a4bcd3e8919c9e6b9b5a581cf4ab918b80d4287b92c82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3306607ec8c53f1e15cf373c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我必定会报答──象征家跟\r\n师父的恩情……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5906d05b986c2d5c411330ee8d699f4c64230ff8f2f2008680b1745233aaa1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abf4ad2cfaa8b429f2e7fc1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作业──已经在午休时写完了。\r\n可以心无旁鹜地进行训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51c0e5bc4b433318697019998559fe2ed6be731578554041bd8d6d936443311e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f7c465145d3c0217dd189d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟你的──合作任务。\r\n作战成功率……很高。\r\n──目标是……完全达成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0587995b19a078bdb8577295ddd99e6d0380f825f63a8ad5f47efeeb61b71924",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b39b941caab8e1089ce9d103",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然是你想的训练项目……\r\n就不会有……不足之处。\r\nLet's go for it.",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f1ba6bfcecfc4cf09343816209b3665698a5e23b58a99333071eb45b2d7c8d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c69d8c10e54e63eaa7edd960",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你不需要──说话。\r\n我们──已经有了默契。\r\n我相信──你的选择。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd1a9c1075e39513537adbbd6a4817d17e58c24db0425119c16fc2d48244bb5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ccf72e6b537a6c131544e01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "盛夏──最好喝硬水。\r\n可以补充容易缺乏的矿物质。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce0eae5d8dcd9f402dc8b7a3fd608923a0318983a94e35ade6325b10e57343fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01fa0a0525554c212f3c717a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "関節部への注油――\r\nもとい、ストレッチは――\r\nすでに――完了済みだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6561a1b2ac1047bf34de93d2534813df4b32f621f66d4b161c4441d8f01f456",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf2b9eba8890b0137741028d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "精密無比の――技術。\r\n任務を果たす――意志。\r\n2つを――両立させたいものだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eb8bebf6e730ad15cf04755ed8b4dea208336554aaa8ea15c3963b053948b77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab161d6bbfae9248eaaff1be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正確に――program――\r\n実行する。――機械人形のごとく。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ec7b0fa6dcc1d766b39169e940e4aea37e22b0e898b6fe70f17b0fe47cc3f6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35eb24b1b988d59eb3625262",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なんなりと――指示を。\r\n使命を果たすため――それに従う。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecfa05f98e35976eb727c9a2a372f956fc65ac983b80848e6ba25bbb80b29504",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08ea6deaf909547a6f626b1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "機械を――演じていようと――\r\nお前への――信頼に――\r\n変わりはない。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02fe7fee705f849e909cda0612774eccc6d5019ff68e819f3e39fb28064eb41b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b10ae3b35a825823bef40e16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "主よ。指令を。\r\n――やはり――トレーナーと\r\n呼ぶほうが――しっくりくるな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa4e869e2f150d7aba4419d5c9c406063e5feb386a1c4d5bcb000f5ea6f37824",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:225a85fd4b67d650012e9885",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "共に――任務を果たした時。\r\n未知の――感情を――\r\n私は――得るのだろうか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0111096da69da315f15d060fb738843cbd6dbf653726d6b45a97a4087b08d1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8b820adbc67947808033265",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很庆幸──你是我的签约训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e064bd7382879f3d3fe4df44ecbb31a5b01dd35a282513f9d9dcd3e12db22824",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdfdce85d3a768f3c165ebd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "I can't thank you enough.",
      "source_fingerprint": "d03f38609a55596815377e591bcbcaa17ca84eb7d17d12fceaa203750d7a9fe5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05af598837faea7a5735b457",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これほどの、感情は――初めてだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e097b16f4883866bd5ce9b6f933ed202d5a00888108f3a4fe7b4b0675de19e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ff48b4f0ac5816d40e2c389",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーは――最高のengineerだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbdb6256905d0b5e4d5f934beb272698e0018a12ba8ea551ff010c466cf2b181",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c27bbae9170166c7f66a4c37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能力──强化了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aee9fe11f2f62a68f7997c3324b5dfca72ea7253b83ea7c7c063225d7e6978e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b58e7fbfe184f242c8d6fa7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有──limit。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a344d097fb876ca2f392215b4f9cfcd97167f40b9ad7a7ab050f792c002cfa7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46fc6cc2f1ed64f6a1535cec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Yes.\r\n我是吉兆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d20682670d352059380f7f6a757326bf9494daaee04912b1036cf2aa1b1af39e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2693687a31bb7b4522e2a91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Mission──开始。\r\n一切都是为了报恩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5eda86805d9068e6df5c9c8c22476bd2569e34ff615469364d945c0742aea9e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19e2e7a0390b5960c941d185",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更有效率地进行支持。",
      "source_fingerprint": "292b09dd86c985b251461e0e855d22fd02036083fd5bb2206832d2037a9be63e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f893c8d44885b1d57b08996",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经改善并强化了合作体制。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71e77311b6a8d17ba9a271d14b2d70cf2f32366c33495fb0b98fe0a5e1ca8a80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0581491a540cf760b4eff7d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Oilを――注されるとは――こんな気分か。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28307f2acb6b70380535c528233146f7a7d53bb77e7a1a00487646e8557b3d8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee1752c5d2192ac4d8156de3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拡張機能、解放――",
      "source_fingerprint": "71963ae95af02e18c318d304f56103fe1df9dead12a2806940388dc98e70dba2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87382c97c14934a72b710e44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目覚めさせたのは――お前か\r\n共に――使命を果たそう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02869396628039911cc12840b5a7014f02b485586d158d81e3dc219157101c39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2a27236c890ad8f4a3efd8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "シンボリクリスエス――起動。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0cddc25f6aaa2ef407f2a2f7d290e5af75466f8ac677bba4101f0b5df767154",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:001f0ffb5f854cbbfa0688c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "战士啊，集合吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c3f13542f7a1cd20894fedea598b718dd0b3ffb4ddc88e33141061125067ca9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8117bc957ded0950126b5dec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，举杯庆祝吧！\r\n敬吾的可能性、敬约定的剧本！\r\n还有──敬你的酩酊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c82821cf1d9f4d0afe320aa9824358ad1eaa276756d49bef361e706a6a60b71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe35b936790298cb057657b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f254bb38f67ab6ddc8bcc4b23788814ea17cc25235579b53cfe10633510135ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6aed6f70139172b196f2a4e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帰ったぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29ad959e7d38bf0879fa29694e9dfb266be6347e47e6b87a96796c63131331ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccf706617f2f214b1b66a0ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有义务要让你持续感受。\r\n感受我改变世界的胜利欢呼──\r\n以及终将诞生的混沌……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd494a47009698b772292533bd0e426fb03c368235b6c9404ff03a05e972f21d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1afc66b10c4b9829af18074b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "深渊的另一端存在着深渊──\r\n酩酊的另一端存在着酩酊──\r\n我尝过了名为你的美酒滋味。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4210db59aae2c1ceaef5cdc9c7f5be8d06ff12a57209d0541f4a60391a7e9ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ca01752e59084f3dece8f85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你听见摇撼黑夜的钟声了吗？\r\n看来众人已将酒瓶举向太阳神了啊。\r\n──新年快乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffa5131eaa013cc15d3de5cfd6cd24b74288a0f03f330718fe3fc9b7c9c511d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7784385fcd397a7036497984",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "允许爱、诉说爱、彼此相爱。\r\n就在勾起手指的今天许下永恒承诺。\r\n──如同圣人的祈祷一般。",
      "source_fingerprint": "494f57b006145ac8318e9cb735bdf6db657359ef219f30badc6a76f66c6a225c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ba561f043ad691fddcbf2db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快，将手伸进去吧！\r\n礼物究竟会融化还是凋零──\r\n真相只有你一个人知道！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0637ab3e65dde1a0e90e37741d08bdf6337ccb5b46bf250d1587cd80c605f6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c82791dcc0ccd2566ebf12b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一年一度的短暂相会啊。\r\n虽然是个在夜空上演的大悲剧……\r\n却也有着能永恒诉说的凄美。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f5bcf90a5c30bf0dbc7bdb167596c1c864ec24fe7c80c8ea41728f87ff51957",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce2f30c755d24767483fafcf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打开门！戴着面具起舞！直至癫狂！\r\n别遗失约定成俗的咒语了──\r\n说吧，不给糖就捣蛋！",
      "source_fingerprint": "db702948f43ce9cb6bc147a3a874b1fd99dada22d9a2755e592162856be20b18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:939bd84fb1adf6baa9f5aceb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这时期的爸爸很忙！\r\n特别的平安夜美酒，\r\n是平安夜餐桌的引导之星！",
      "source_fingerprint": "827437d2e0b0d2319218eda70928ff4b1efae16cd9e2925818bf1ced8068f5e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:013e19b6a6a4ced8d4b16a62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天就特别加入点巧思吧。\r\n这是在杯口抹了白砂糖的白雪风格。\r\n……或许有些过于甜腻了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f17a7364a1fbb9c4cbb28aa9fdff7c5ec335f168ca2af4a37540408d8189247",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d86363078485be79cf61152a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈──哈哈哈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6630049120f78328e9c4c814009806d49fb29d57761d642dda5d35838b473b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4813bdfb1c5ab6d2af85d3df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "逝去的时间化为叙事诗，\r\n新吹起的风催生传说──\r\n啊啊，别错过黎明……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "19ac8be321e9f301bd59dea2b8dccd8ceb611e937f301d0e48b74cbf43250dad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25f80f6cd2ec8fbff57fcd0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐！\r\n领路人……我只有一句话送你──\r\n为永恒剎那的光辉酩酊吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1cf7fa0e3d0174fc4d8939d4756000516b84446253df76e7a5ee7fc93723b74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be420414df788570810ab6de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐。\r\n爸妈托我带了瓶美酒要给你。\r\n……总有一天可要让我也品尝一番。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69a4c8963652b5f9f34fd7d520683faecc7dfc220b2fd9f46efa638302812edf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce7d4e77863b250a0a8a705c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就在这天立誓！\r\n吾之冲动将会刻划于世世代代！\r\n在黑夜中也留下烙印的瞬刻黎明……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a33b0dd6b28acd58a52d76425c2b3ec64da078b530fd88a93e5a49b372a8ffdd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9bbe8abc257677e5924ab1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想庆祝今天？呵──\r\n那就将斯堤克斯之水一饮而尽！\r\n并立誓与我共同刻划剎那吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "170ade2f9d7411a269822ebeb179e566360ff11c75309fa0bd75ee3faa5415ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fa5e966185360bd3c232619",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有个叫什么「公告」的东西在叫了。\r\n用你的手让它陷入沉默吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f504b21143ab5e7ed098f1c0789a3d1ce1274282a48e9c339fb808157c612937",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:753162d7b0bb64e4c633e3bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了啊……！究竟是不是\r\n潘多拉……来，打开看看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b2af32b8e1efff665e324bab2ddf5e89652b6213ea8e8b2fee37d500ea56967",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5b1931c7e2071a8d5e07239",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成──呵。\r\n你也是位通过考验的英雄啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "756ea5d76c18e1f67f55ac7e94b318d528914072dd674b74c2c63f87a9abff8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c63e2106e0d07695a9119143",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "──唔！不久的将来\r\n会发生「活动」！\r\n别小看……这预言！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e909077d73ee0e2ad231e1ae004ffde70c26b2b43338d77fc2077b4734a94a61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dab07ea97b3799e72b171154",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「活动」举办中──换句话说，\r\n新的剧本已经写好了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "830348ee1baa9f701772c4b8c6121ec8e4a7ce49000d5e50ce821068137f8441",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dc5b3c1a3089a843b4463e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别让火焰熄灭……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dff86df3ad63ed393690167659dd776f741a696282ccf451d41dfdba09f4d54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad13e3ea74cb2ecdbcc56aae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n好像提升了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65a15e68cae399a07a8f123918970af118dd7b67faaefbf35d524d7dec353a77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ee1a04a878d117572b36e9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定要赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5bfadb0aa9046edd4760f866b9c1ecbb1d75fe1694adaf4f3dbd98509cf3535",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45cf53354b4491480c372abb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "举杯庆祝吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "979d4f0d643c09149bbaa5de1690a84a15c23ae296eeb6c99e8d5e7d17327877",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a5146cb71abd8e4508e4c26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别让火焰熄灭……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dff86df3ad63ed393690167659dd776f741a696282ccf451d41dfdba09f4d54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c86a6a6c6b5c34edec35212c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定要赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5bfadb0aa9046edd4760f866b9c1ecbb1d75fe1694adaf4f3dbd98509cf3535",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d489032192ae20be14aec18c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵，更新高分纪录了啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a5b24a3fe7bb5167fe9502e8594944746f640d07bdd00144d8a7fd0b20cbaaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5a4a4b4a9e0d06deeb5a8b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，咆哮吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b8aba0cfb21888f6f3a869c308619ba765b454152f3e74236c9a7d2dca26ebb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9241b444955928d20f66e3f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec25c6d8d69f4b3e50dbdd0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "力量会赋予所求之物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96a3fbd539e64b6f9dd01ded1f0beebe09be1f2e6f118c48691b902b746ab593",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "110000"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
